'''Blue Logchopper''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to players who finish as Top 100 on the [[Christmas Event 2019]] Token Collecting Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
Blue Logchopper has the same appearance as [[Logchopper]], but replacing its primary colors with a cyan coloring.

== Trivia ==
* During the [[Christmas Event 2019]], there were 2 different leaderboards; '''Gift-Giving''' and '''Token-Collecting'''. This item came in the '''Token-Collecting''' leaderboard.
* In order to obtain this item, players could collect Winter Tokens (act exactly like [[coins]] but Christmas-exclusive) and points, which determined their rank on the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Logchopper]], [[Silver Logchopper]], and [[Gold Logchopper]].
* This item is a blue reskin of [[Logchopper]], an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].

